Hi Danilo,

ACC_ means that it is the average acceleration
day_ means that it refers to the waking ours of the day

VIG_unbt indicates that person is moving vigorous but outside any of the detected MVPA bouts, we call this unbouted behaviour.

total_VIG indicates that the person is moving vigorous at any moment during those waking hours regardless including both vigorous during MVPA bouts and vigorous outside MVPA bouts.

Best,
Vincent

