Hello,
I hope you're doing well.
I have using GGIR to analyze GENEActiv data.
I have noticed that in Part5 files, the day+sleep wear time for some of the participants is more than 1440-minute day (i.e., 1442, 1460 min/day) which is not realistically plausible. Is there a reason this happens? How can I fix this? Or can this be justified as it's simply part of the software analysis. I have carefully reviewed and used the script several times with no issues other than this. I appreciate any explanation or feedback on this matter.

Thank you,
Sundos

