Dear all,
  I have collected some actigraph data(GT9X) for 14 days each, and I used GGIR to run the analysis. I request the participants to write sleep diaries. However, some forget to write. When running GGIR, we need to add sleep logs to the analysis. Will the missing data of the sleep logs have an impact on the result? Additionally, some participants missed some days of sleep logs. Will that influence the result?  Is there any way to better process the missing data of sleep logs?

