Hi Andy,

Were your data collected in the same time zone where you are processing the data? If it was a different time zone, you would need to define the argument desiredtz, please see the GGIR documentation on this. <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/GGIR/vignettes/GGIRParameters.html#:~:text=non-overlapping%20windows.-,desiredtz,-Character%20(default%20=%20%E2%80%9C%E2%80%9C,%20i> Additionally, if the device was configured in a different timezone, you would also need to provide configtz <https://cran.r-project.org/web/packages/GGIR/vignettes/GGIRParameters.html#:~:text=wiki/Zone.tab-,configtz,-Character%20(default%20=%20%E2%80%9C%E2%80%9C,%20i>.

Best,
Jairo

